{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18720","headline":"感遇二首 一 · 柳宗元","name":"感遇二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西陆动凉气，惊乌号北林。\n栖息岂殊性，集枯安可任。\n鸿鹄去不返，勾吴阻且深。\n徒嗟日沈湎，丸鼓骛奇音。\n东海久摇荡，南风已駸駸。\n坐使青天暮，小星愁太阴。\n衆情嗜奸利，居货捐千金。\n危根一以振，齐斧来相寻。\n揽衣中夜起，感物涕盈襟。\n微霜衆所践，谁念岁寒心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}